==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{term|elapser|lang=frm}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|elapsus|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|æps|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|elaps}}

# {{context|intransitive|of time|lang=en}} To [[pass]] or [[move]] [[by]].
#: ''He allowed a month to '''elapse''' before beginning the work.''
#: ''Several days '''elapsed''' before they met again.''

